  m_Name: Savanna
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayName: Savanna
  Description: "Head-high golden grass under flat-topped thorns and grey baobabs,
    granite kopjes stacked like giants' cairns, red termite spires, the dry season's
    fires running orange across the hills at night \u2014 and the curving drystone
    walls of the stone-house kings"
